  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Today is Grandma's birthday. The family has lunch at her house. Grandma is in the kitchen. She makes rice for lunch. Mom has a bag of green peas. She puts them in the rice. Lily is with her. \"I like peas,\" says Lily. Pip sits and looks at the rice.",
      "Dad is not in the kitchen. He plays football with Tom in the garden. Dad likes sport. Tom is very good at football. Grandpa watches them from a chair. He has a funny hat. \"Go, Tom, go!\" says Grandpa. Grandpa likes to sing. Tom kicks the ball to Dad. \"Lunch!\" says Mom.",
      "Mom puts a pie on the table. \"What is in it?\" asks Tom. \"Pears!\" says Mom. It is a pear pie! \"Happy birthday, Grandma!\" says Lily. Grandma smiles. \"Thank you, family,\" she says. Then Grandpa stands. He sings a song for Grandma. The song is old and nice. The family claps. Pip says, \"Woof, woof!\""
    ],
    "summary": "The family has lunch for Grandma's birthday. Each person does one thing, and Grandpa sings a song for Grandma.",
